# Deploy

appfacts.dev is a **git-connected Worker** (not a Pages project). A push to `origin/main` deploys `site/` automatically.

`pnpm ship` is the optional direct upload (`wrangler deploy --config site/wrangler.jsonc`). Use it to publish the working tree without a GitHub push. Do not use `wrangler pages deploy`.
